stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Closed: accepted source first appears
    Closed --> Open: partner expands source
    Open --> Closed: partner closes source
    Open --> Open: update or refresh returns same source
    Closed --> Closed: update or refresh returns same source
    Open --> Open: refresh fails, stale source remains
    Open --> Closed: accepted source identity or content changes
    Open --> Absent: accepted row disappears or is filtered out
    Closed --> Absent: accepted row disappears or is filtered out
    Absent --> Closed: row returns
    Open --> Retired: session retires or mount disposes
    Closed --> Retired: session retires or mount disposes
    Retired --> [*]
